zproj is an application-layer reasoning and safety-policy engine for Zephyr RTOS.
It does not implement hardware timing fabrics, packet departure gates, global tick
distribution, interconnect scheduling, GPU scheduling, DMA scheduling, FPGA
constraint fabrics, or proprietary Layer1Labs systems.
